    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[Golana Elects Wachsman, Grasso Editors-In-Chief For Coming Year]]></title>
      <link>https://polyarchives.hosting.nyu.edu/items/show/513</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<div class="element-set">
        <h2>Dublin Core</h2>
